gd e1 +- ang 10800000 dang
gd sw1 +- e1 0 s1
gd s2 +- s1 10800000 0
gd wa sin iwd2 s1
gd ha cos ihd2 s1
gd dxa cat2 iwd2 ha wa
gd dya sat2 ihd2 ha wa
gd xa +- hc dxa 0
gd ya +- vc dya 0
gd wb sin iwd2 s2
gd hb cos ihd2 s2
gd dxb cat2 iwd2 hb wb
gd dyb sat2 ihd2 hb wb
gd xb +- hc dxb 0
gd yb +- vc dyb 0
p
M l vc; A wd2 hd2 cd2 cd4; A wd2 hd2 3cd4 cd4; A wd2 hd2 0 cd4; A wd2 hd2 cd4 cd4; Z; M xa ya; A iwd2 ihd2 s1 sw1; Z; M xb yb; A iwd2 ihd2 s2 sw1; Z

